{"items":[{"id":"1513884411116802048","title":"就教科书那个事啊.... 一般来说，就像类…","content":"<p>就教科书那个事啊....&lt;br&gt;一般来说，就像类似虹猫蓝兔这类的动画片一样，像这种面对公众的教材肯定是会收到大量举报的，但问题的关键在于什么呢？&lt;br&gt;举报虹猫蓝兔，有人处理，举报教科书，没人处理....&lt;br&gt;而且再想一个问题:&lt;br&gt;为什么过去这么多年都没问题，今年却有问题了呢？</p>","excerpt":"就教科书那个事啊.... 一般来说，就像类…","voteupCount":308,"commentCount":42,"created":1653718170,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1513884411116802048"},{"id":"1513778258970079232","title":"看了人教版教科书的乱象，我有点恍惚，教…","content":"<p>看了人教版教科书的乱象，我有点恍惚，教育的毒瘤真的在教培吗？</p>","excerpt":"看了人教版教科书的乱象，我有点恍惚，教…","voteupCount":166,"commentCount":25,"created":1653692861,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1513778258970079232"},{"id":"1513499939313627136","title":"赢！","content":"<p>赢！</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-d511ba746e1fbd1671707e286f1a78b0_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"828\" height=\"446\">","excerpt":"赢！","voteupCount":150,"commentCount":36,"created":1653626504,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1513499939313627136"},{"id":"1512910966262554625","title":"很多朋友邀请我去写经济这个事..... 就怎…","content":"<p>很多朋友邀请我去写经济这个事.....&lt;br&gt;就怎么说呢，在防疫期间发展经济真的是一件特别考验政治智慧的事情。&lt;br&gt;在你没有这个智慧的时候，我建议大家还是歇着点好。</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-65febf80e96a3eb935c8996725245c1c_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"522\">","excerpt":"很多朋友邀请我去写经济这个事..... 就怎…","voteupCount":147,"commentCount":13,"created":1653486082,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1512910966262554625"},{"id":"1512490190064701440","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-93bd53ff305d1162914a6fe32a0c135e_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"827\" height=\"906\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":144,"commentCount":11,"created":1653385762,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1512490190064701440"},{"id":"1512386562294222848","title":"这毕业生数据有来源吗.....","content":"<p>这毕业生数据有来源吗.....</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7aa592f30df391ab85b049254588f19c_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"928\" height=\"681\">","excerpt":"这毕业生数据有来源吗.....","voteupCount":150,"commentCount":19,"created":1653361055,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1512386562294222848"},{"id":"1512122842375798784","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-60ced8e64d9f3f1adb053fc660e66725_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"864\" height=\"1920\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":177,"commentCount":17,"created":1653298179,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1512122842375798784"},{"id":"1511430717129572352","title":"我有点怀疑知乎在暗示什么，但我没有证据","content":"<p>我有点怀疑知乎在暗示什么，但我没有证据</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-7d040e945e254b7cebd41eab77ed8448_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"579\">","excerpt":"我有点怀疑知乎在暗示什么，但我没有证据","voteupCount":123,"commentCount":9,"created":1653133163,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1511430717129572352"},{"id":"1510617683494514688","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f3ad8685d8a69b5c19d42854c1003f28_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1170\" height=\"480\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":123,"commentCount":36,"created":1652939321,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1510617683494514688"},{"id":"1509560252765237250","title":"有了IP属地还是挺魔幻的","content":"<p>有了IP属地还是挺魔幻的。&lt;br&gt;说上海能自由活动的都是外地IP，说不能的都是上海IP...</p>","excerpt":"有了IP属地还是挺魔幻的","voteupCount":110,"commentCount":10,"created":1652687210,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1509560252765237250"}]}